      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄并未就此停下脚步。\n她只是多背负了一件宝贵的事物，\n然后继续向前走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba384f16473de4bb11de0497b8c35ffb85e2f129bdce424efbbc13eaa22d1859",
